.TH CRUNCH_FADVISE64 3crunch "" "Crunch" "Crunch Library Manual"
.SH NAME
crunch_fadvise64 \- Linux x86-64 syscall 221
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <sys/syscall_220_259.h>
.B int crunch_fadvise64(int descriptor, off_t offset, off_t length, int advice);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
Invokes the raw fadvise64 syscall; unlike posix_fadvise, errors return -1 and set errno.
This is a direct Linux x86-64 syscall wrapper; availability and permissions depend on the kernel and security policy.
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns the syscall result, or \-1 with errno set on failure.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR fadvise64 (2)
